This policy is inspired by the Toyota Production System's Andon cord concept, where any worker on the assembly line can stop the production line to report a defect. In this case, any volunteer developer can trigger the incident policy to report a problem with the course registration website. The club's maintainers will be notified and will investigate and resolve the issue as soon as possible.

